{"step_index":866,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:14:34Z","input_tokens":2862,"cache_read_tokens":69580,"output_tokens":1021,"thinking":"Identified two distinct real estate listings. Each listing includes an address and phone number, implying these are contact details for properties located in Busan. The listings are for \"센텀예일공인중개사사무소\" and \"13. 화린\" respectively.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nfunction extractCompanyPhone(text, cName, addr) {\n  // Find cName occurrence\n  const regex = new RegExp('(?:^|[^가-힣])' + cName + '(?:[^가-힣]|$)', 'g');\n  let match;\n  while ((match = regex.exec(text)) !== null) {\n    const start = match.index;\n    const chunk = text.substring(start, start + 250);\n    // check if addr parts in chunk\n    if (chunk.includes('404호') || chunk.includes('재송동') || chunk.includes('부산')) {\n      const telMatch = chunk.match(/(?:연락처|전화|TEL|Tel|대표번호)?[\\s:]{0,5}((?:051|02|070|010|1[568][0-9]{2})-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4})/);\n      if (telMatch) {\n        return telMatch[1];\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n\nconst sampleSnippet = '13. 화린 부산광역시 해운대구 재송동 1208-2 비동 404호 연락처 : 1522-3008 부산푸르지오분양';\nconsole.log('Extracted:', extractCompanyPhone(sampleSnippet, '화린', '부산 해운대구 재송동'));\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing regex extraction","toolSummary":"Test regex extraction on hwarin"}}]}
