{"step_index":868,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:14:45Z","input_tokens":3146,"cache_read_tokens":70407,"output_tokens":697,"thinking":"Investigating why `telMatch` produced a null result. The number `1522-3008` has the format `1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4}`. The regular expression should be `(1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4})`. The initial regular expression `(?:051|02|070|010|1[568][0-9]{2})-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}` was incorrect because the hyphens were doubled after the `1522` part.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nfunction extractCompanyPhone(text, cName, addr) {\n  // Find cName occurrence\n  const cleanSnippet = text.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ');\n  const regex = new RegExp('(?:^|[^가-힣])' + cName + '(?:[^가-힣]|$)', 'g');\n  let match;\n  while ((match = regex.exec(cleanSnippet)) !== null) {\n    const start = match.index;\n    const chunk = cleanSnippet.substring(start, start + 250);\n    const telMatch = chunk.match(/(?:051|02|070|01[016789])-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}|1[568][0-9]{2}-[0-9]{4}/);\n    if (telMatch) {\n      return { phone: telMatch[0], chunk };\n    }\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n\nconst sampleSnippet = '13. 화린 부산광역시 해운대구 재송동 1208-2 비동 404호 연락처 : 1522-3008 부산푸르지오분양';\nconsole.log('Extracted:', extractCompanyPhone(sampleSnippet, '화린', '부산 해운대구 재송동'));\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing regex fix","toolSummary":"Test corrected regex"}}]}
